    <briefdescription>
<para>Lightweight unit-test helpers for Marmot material and numerical routines. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Provides templated equality checks (<computeroutput>checkIfEqual</computeroutput>) for scalars, Eigen matrices, Eigen tensors and Fastor tensors, as well as higher-level utilities such as <computeroutput>throwExceptionOnFailure</computeroutput>, the Fibonacci hemisphere sampler <computeroutput>fibonacciLatticeHemisphere</computeroutput>, and the <computeroutput>spinTurbokreisel</computeroutput> material-point test. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
